---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Siddharth Bhadu" description="Software Engineer specializing in Java, Spring Boot, and low-level systems.">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="bio">
      <h1>Siddharth Bhadu.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        I craft high-performance backend systems and explore low-level computing — turning complex problems into elegant solutions.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        I am a Software Engineer with 3+ years of experience, specializing in Java and the Spring ecosystem. I've scaled data exports to 1M+ rows, accelerated data retrieval by 25%, and automated 6+ hour manual workflows with Spring Batch at companies like Oqulto Technologies and Capgemini.
      </p>

      <p>
        Beyond backend development, I'm deeply passionate about systems programming, AI integration, and building tools that eliminate developer friction. Whether it's building a <strong>CHIP-8 Emulator in Java</strong>, optimizing a local LLM benchmarking tool, or designing microservices, I believe great software comes from understanding systems at every level.
      </p>

      <h2>Selected Projects</h2>
      <ul class="projects-list">
        <li>
          <strong><a href="https://github.com/sidhu1512/chip-8" target="_blank">CHIP-8 Emulator</a></strong> — 35-opcode virtual machine with CPU emulation & low-level graphics rendering.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong><a href="https://github.com/sidhu1512/PocketBench" target="_blank">PocketBench</a></strong> — Local LLM benchmarking tool with automated performance testing.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong><a href="https://sidhu1512.github.io/SharePaste/" target="_blank">SharePaste</a></strong> — Serverless paste service with Zstandard compression & zero data storage via WASM.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Connect</h2>
      <ul class="social-links">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/sidhu1512" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/siddharth-bhadu-71a483193" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://sidhu1512.github.io/" target="_blank">Portfolio</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:siddharthbhadu.work@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-container {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lead {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
  .projects-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .projects-list li {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
  }
  .projects-list a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .projects-list a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .social-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .social-links a {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
